"""Baked ASCII glyphs for the simulator progress panels; no runtime font dependency.

Rasterized from DejaVu Sans Bold at 28 px with Pillow on a 32x32 canvas:
draw.text((max(1, -font.getbbox(character, anchor="ls")[0]), 25), character,
          font=font, anchor="ls", fill=255), threshold 128.
Rows are 32-bit big-endian masks. Advances are ceil(font.getlength(char)) + 2.
The glyph data is distributed under the font license reproduced below.
"""

